      "message": "This is used in the send_goodcrc function but is not needed.\nThe 2-bit Specification Revision field of a GoodCRC Message does not carry any meaning and Shall be considered as don’t care by the recipient of the Message. The sender of a GoodCRC Message Should set the Specification Revision field to 00b.\nI\u0027ll remove this.",
